  "sourceFindings": [
    "Human female original corsair captain; brown hair gathered high in a voluminous, loose curled updo, warm skin and uncovered face.",
    "Long burgundy coat with golden piping/trim, white blouse beneath black buttoned corset, dark trousers, belts and high black/gold boots.",
    "Fine cyan blade with gold basket guard held by anatomical RIGHT hand; ornate brass/black/cyan pistol held by anatomical LEFT hand in the actual portrait.",
    "Floating industrial islands, brass pressure machinery and open sky belong to Aerolith; liberation of lower working islands and ether monopoly are the specific setting."
  ],
